{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115077","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115077/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115077/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115077/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/115077","id":3825811231,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7kCT8f","number":115077,"title":"PackedScene fails to be parsed after an external script tries to load a property containing a Node outside the Scene","user":{"login":"Leonpizza","id":182265737,"node_id":"U_kgDOCt0niQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/182265737?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leonpizza","html_url":"https://github.com/Leonpizza","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leonpizza/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leonpizza/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leonpizza/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leonpizza/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leonpizza/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leonpizza/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leonpizza/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leonpizza/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Leonpizza/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":410064485,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw0MTAwNjQ0ODU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/needs%20testing","name":"needs testing","color":"ffcc44","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-01-17T20:50:24Z","updated_at":"2026-01-19T14:39:40Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.5.1.stable.mono  (only uses GDScript)\n- couldn't test earlier due to the project not being able to downgrade\n\n### System information\n\nHappens on Windows 10 and EndeavourOS (Arch Linux)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIt happens right after this line of code gets added to a script inside the PackedScene:\n``` gdscript\nprint(Globals.root_manager)\n```\nIt fails to serialize when it tries to access _root_manager_. _root_manager_ is the top Node of the project, a child of ```get_tree().root``` (because it allows handling scene changes easier.) So root_manager is **outside** the PackedScene's structure.\n\nIf every line trying to access Globals.root_manager is removed, it works flawlessly\n\n<img width=\"1139\" height=\"243\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b48d6f1f-4a7f-4f7d-914a-063a4334f5fc\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nPress play and it should break, it gives the same errors as in the image above, but in the mrp\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nFile:\n\n[attempt-at-recreation.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24691956/attempt-at-recreation.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115077/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115077/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}